{"version":1,"content":"<p>河套香港園區公司宣布，第一期第二輪三組地塊發展項目於今日（20日）中午截止招標，合共接獲9份標書，入標企業包括前沿科技公司、有園區營運經驗的企業及大型綜合企業，認為足見業界對河套香港園區前景的信心。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:03.762899+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:05:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T17:17:37.903569+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684168+00:00","content_hash":"0e95d0ca50217b2e7c81c713e864ebac2fcba03d38eaccbd42b13832147f2891","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}